[bot] <open-swe@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Mason Daugherty <mason@langchain.dev>","verified_at":"2026-08-03T14:37:07Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/fbe4ec8046c35313c6c05a986779111d84fe2536","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/fbe4ec8046c35313c6c05a986779111d84fe2536","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/fbe4ec8046c35313c6c05a986779111d84fe2536/comments","author":{"login":"aolsenjazz","id":13665641,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNjY1NjQx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13665641?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aolsenjazz","html_url":"https://github.com/aolsenjazz","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aolsenjazz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aolsenjazz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aolsenjazz/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aolsenjazz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aolsenjazz/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aolsenjazz/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aolsenjazz/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aolsenjazz/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aolsenjazz/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"6dd2a7d2f83bd63844a987f6ec65ac9244ec8c5b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/6dd2a7d2f83bd63844a987f6ec65ac9244ec8c5b","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/6dd2a7d2f83bd63844a987f6ec65ac9244ec8c5b"}]},{"sha":"6dd2a7d2f83bd63844a987f6ec65ac9244ec8c5b","node_id":"C_kwDOPTymldoAKDZkZDJhN2QyZjgzYmQ2Mzg0NGE5ODdmNmVjNjVhYzkyNDRlYzhjNWI","commit":{"author":{"name":"Nishitha M","email":"32355027+imnishitha@users.noreply.github.com","date":"2026-08-03T14:29:47Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-08-03T14:29:47Z"},"message":"fix(sdk): resolve exact-file `delete` targets with first-match-wins o… (#5229)\n\nCloses #5113\n\n`delete` now uses the same first-match-wins permission check as\n`write_file` and `edit_file` when deleting a confirmed leaf target (a\nfile or an empty location). This makes the documented\nworkspace-isolation pattern (`allow /workspace/**`, then `deny /**`)\nwork consistently for deletes.\n\nFor targets that may have descendants (directories or uncertain paths),\nthe existing conservative behavior is unchanged: any denied descendant\nstill blocks the recursive delete. To distinguish the two cases,\n`delete` uses the backend's existing `ls` to detect whether the target\nhas nested entries.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: open-swe[bot] <open-swe@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"3b4dd84da001d2bb8f77ee1001f5907d9637a379","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/3b4dd84da001d2bb8f77ee1001f5907d9637a379"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/6dd2a7d2f83bd63844a987f6ec65ac9244ec8c5b","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqcKXbCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAntEQACfHo08ezHC/SRKvhYtxEVm8\nhEdFXPDlzQHe8pT/A2rS8VDg8kaVYNNxzgFDzG0s2LsAgv28S54ALKRro8KYqHPw\n11nJuIET6icvqrR9g6s91Ot592QyhzKOceXOFFbBb7q4otxYUJaj42ZMAuRKtOnj\nCGkn5hHi32CQ6J3Kw3VYMYlFX8Hz0deKWkU/NXH/ms4PcJAeNuunU1a6CPaDBBh7\nM4SWBbNmCdV8+tM8LxYGmwCFna1AXDZ5MSyaAgTk9CneRLPvWEbcDMWLZuyvN4zy\nrJhAJ91a9JtWjNqz87EnZhzONtmxYEQJnR5Rk4GPbEpNDW/9XMV883a21B9q2vyk\nSt+QdbWq3xjZsC/Bg+gI7vkr7lJ6EHmHlrwV/SXsw44PvIVtkHZtshvOq7zUtJLH\n7AaXY0XQACNOO0+kNimOAaXL4qbvcXH1ih5/qGWNG7nRfRAMoGD8rkvFh003DmDV\nRetCQA+vUBYSh9lOPgyWTV5YInCSwp2/vuzE1NRapOJ0Wngu7QgQzDnWcBZtpigl\nX+8FSVQvHLrtKWOmgo32GdvIT+DQbgtgOfNsoOUttVtOx1IqBU4j4LYO9kTMh+O6\nJwPva/AZf6Xj0+G6AXwdeTaBOXf1NVCiQLmwkkMBx/SM7f8JE+Dpj9Fs1Sg8ugAi\nMfQUa9ORbr6ANI5W5dej\n=q95l\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree 3b4dd84da001d2bb8f77ee1001f5907d9637a379\nparent 00637212084c7fe4c12993c95ab559b92aaa4fef\nauthor Nishitha M <32355027+imnishitha@users.noreply.github.com> 1785767387 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1785767387 -0400\n\nfix(sdk): resolve exact-file `delete` targets with first-match-wins o… (#5229)\n\nCloses #5113\n\n`delete` now uses the same first-match-wins permission check as\n`write_file` and `edit_file` when deleting a confirmed leaf target (a\nfile or an empty location). This makes the documented\nworkspace-isolation pattern (`allow /workspace/**`, then `deny /**`)\nwork consistently for deletes.\n\nFor targets that may have descendants (directories or uncertain paths),\nthe existing conservative behavior is unchanged: any denied descendant\nstill blocks the recursive delete. To distinguish the two cases,\n`delete` uses the backend's existing `ls` to detect whether the target\nhas nested entries.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: open-swe[bot] <open-swe@users.noreply.github.com>","verified_at":"2026-08-03T14:29:48Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/6dd2a7d2f83bd63844a987f6ec65ac9244ec8c5b","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/6dd2a7d2f83bd63844a987f6ec65ac9244ec8c5b","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/6dd2a7d2f83bd63844a987f6ec65ac9244ec8c5b/comments","author":{"login":"imnishitha","id":32355027,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMzU1MDI3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32355027?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/imnishitha","html_url":"https://github.com/imnishitha","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imnishitha/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imnishitha/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imnishitha/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imnishitha/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imnishitha/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imnishitha/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imnishitha/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imnishitha/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imnishitha/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":